WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Type //3,2:error
Find errors with three lines before and two lines after.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.300
Browse the matching events
Gray lines provide context; the error stays highlighted.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.900
Type x — remove last filter
Undo the smart find and return to the full log.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.900
Type timeout
Add a focused include filter for timeout events.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.900
Type cache — exclude noisy matches
Stack an exclude filter without losing the timeout filter.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.500
Type x — remove last filter
Remove only the cache exclusion; both timeout events return.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.400
Press Tab — inspect structured columns
The same active filter can be viewed as a table.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.700
Type x — restore the full log
Remove timeout and resume browsing all events.
